  <p class="big">Vol. 3: The Return</p>
  <p>
    After a very public break from streaming, Tfue returned. For Vol. 3, I used
    the classic comic book story of a hero's return. Tfue came back to streaming
    with this installment of Tfue Tuesday, and it was a major event in
    competitive Fortnite.
  </p>
